    "Transfer from glibenclamide/glimepiride/torsemide is structural/class-level rather than exact-condition matched.",
    "The impact of full ionization, high TPSA, and possible transporter-mediated absorption on glipizide F remains unresolved.",
    "No intestinal-metabolism experiment for the query molecule was provided."
